E24  REPRODUCIBILITY RECORD
====================================================================================================
  python        3.14.3
  platform      Windows-11-10.0.26200-SP0
  processor     AMD64 Family 25 Model 80 Stepping 0, AuthenticAMD
  numpy         2.4.2
  torch         2.12.0+cpu  threads=1
  scikit-learn  1.8.0

  SEEDS.  Every split is numpy default_rng(seed) with seed = 0..K-1 in
  experiments/real_data.py::split; hyperparameter selection uses
  1000 + seed so that a validation split never coincides with a test
  split.  Simulations seed from hash((cell..., rep)) so that two cells
  never share a stream.  Torch is seeded inside kanrel.fit.fit.

  SPLIT COUNTS.  protocol_decomp and nuisance_dim use 20 splits;
  flexibility uses 20 seeds; simulations use 20 replications per cell.
  All standard errors labelled 'NB SE' carry the Nadeau-Bengio
  correction for overlapping resamples and are the ones the resolution
  verdicts use.

